### Get all account mappings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/account-mappings

### Create account mapping
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/account-mappings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rawAccount": "mKonto Intensive 5611 ... 1026",
  "displayName": "mBank ROR"
}

### Create multiple account mappings
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/account-mappings/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "rawAccount": "mKonto Intensive 5611 ... 1026",
    "displayName": "mBank ROR"
  },
  {
    "rawAccount": "Karta Visa 1234",
    "displayName": "Credit Card"
  }
]
